# VaR & Backtesting Dashboard
An offline Streamlit dashboard for portfolio VaR risk monitoring and backtesting.

## 1. Install Dependencies
Run in terminal:
Bash
pip install streamlit pandas matplotlib
## 2. Run the Dashboard
Navigate to the project root directory and run:
Bash
streamlit run app/app.py
The browser will automatically open http://localhost:8501.

Dynamic Visualization: Displays 1-day 99% VaR vs. Realized P&L over a 250-day rolling window.